---
title: Jira Task Automation Flow
---
flowchart TD
    Start([Manual Trigger]) --> GetTasks[Get My Assigned Tasks<br/>Jira API]
    GetTasks --> FilterTasks{Filter Parent<br/>Tasks Only}
    FilterTasks --> LoopTasks[Loop Each Task]
    
    LoopTasks --> Breakdown[Break Down into Subtasks<br/>Rule-Based Logic]
    
    Breakdown --> LoopSubtasks[Loop Each Subtask]
    
    LoopSubtasks --> Estimate[Calculate Estimation<br/>Based on Complexity]
    
    Estimate --> CreateSubtask[Create Subtask in Jira<br/>with Estimation]
    
    CreateSubtask --> AssignSubtask[Assign Subtask to Me]
    
    AssignSubtask --> MoreSubtasks{More<br/>Subtasks?}
    MoreSubtasks -->|Yes| LoopSubtasks
    MoreSubtasks -->|No| ExtractFeature[Extract Feature Name<br/>from Task Summary]
    
    ExtractFeature --> CreateBranch[Create Bitbucket Branch<br/>feature/name-TASKKEY]
    
    CreateBranch --> MoreTasks{More<br/>Tasks?}
    MoreTasks -->|Yes| LoopTasks
    MoreTasks -->|No| End([Automation Complete])

    style Start fill:#e1f5e1
    style End fill:#e1f5e1
    style GetTasks fill:#e3f2fd
    style Breakdown fill:#fff3e0
    style CreateSubtask fill:#f3e5f5
    style CreateBranch fill:#fce4ec
